worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_behavior_rules_and_self_facts.js"
  ceiling 742
  rationale "Translation marker detection, the behavior-rule listing, count, brief and detail answers, and the self-fact and self-introduction answers. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Lowered to 1202 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the conversation-topic edge cleaner left for the role_slot value source of the shared rule interpreter. Lowered from 1202 to 744 on 2026-10-08 for R1188-U1: the behavior-rule catalog prose (topic and rule labels, matched prompts, When X then Y statements, list footer, change hint, count and brief sentences, taught-rule answers) left for data/seed/multilingual-responses-behavior-rules.lino, read by intent as the native handler reads it. Ceiling moved 744 to 746 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds. Shared stable identifiers now delegate to the existing canonical generated engine_stable_identifier factory; removing the duplicate hash loop lowers this module to 742 without raising a ceiling."
